    "title": "Andrea Onori",
    "lead": "",
    "body": "It began in the Marche, where I was born. Today I'm based in **Milan** and work internationally as an independent filmmaker, mostly in fashion, advertising and media. I follow each project from the first idea to the *final cut*, treating every story as a film of its own.\n\nEmotions rarely arrive with a shape: my craft is building the frame they need to find their meaning. [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/andrea__onori)",
